config XIAOTAI_PART_CAMERA_DVP_NATIVE
    bool "Apply the reviewed DVP camera driver overlay"
    default n
    help
        The default uses the original esp32-camera public API. Select this only
        with the reviewed driver to use native nonblocking dequeue, producer
        drop counters and checked SCCB cleanup. Legacy products are unaffected.
